\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces YOLO-CLIP image-level adaptation. Class-name embeddings from a frozen CLIP text encoder initialize 181 trainable vectors; the YOLO-World detector remains frozen. Non-maximum suppression (NMS) removes redundant overlapping detections. Training pools the maximum region score for each animal class before NMS, appends a fixed \texttt  {empty} logit, and applies image-level cross-entropy. Inference selects the highest-scoring detection after NMS, or \texttt  {empty} below a validation-selected threshold. No bounding-box labels or separate CLIP crop classifier are used.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{3}{YOLO-CLIP image-level adaptation. Class-name embeddings from a frozen CLIP text encoder initialize 181 trainable vectors; the YOLO-World detector remains frozen. Non-maximum suppression (NMS) removes redundant overlapping detections. Training pools the maximum region score for each animal class before NMS, appends a fixed \texttt {empty} logit, and applies image-level cross-entropy. Inference selects the highest-scoring detection after NMS, or \texttt {empty} below a validation-selected threshold. No bounding-box labels or separate CLIP crop classifier are used}{figure.1}{}}
