\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Image-level macro-F1 (\%). ID and OOD denote familiar and unseen camera locations. The fixed-norm ResNet result is a three-seed mean; the other trained classifier results are single runs. The YOLO-CLIP checkpoint was selected on IDVal cross-entropy. Asterisks mark OODVal scores used to select each detector's \texttt  {empty} threshold, so they are tuning scores rather than independent evaluations. Dashes denote unmeasured splits.}}{4}{table.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:baselines}{{1}{4}{Image-level macro-F1 (\%). ID and OOD denote familiar and unseen camera locations. The fixed-norm ResNet result is a three-seed mean; the other trained classifier results are single runs. The YOLO-CLIP checkpoint was selected on IDVal cross-entropy. Asterisks mark OODVal scores used to select each detector's \texttt {empty} threshold, so they are tuning scores rather than independent evaluations. Dashes denote unmeasured splits}{table.1}{}}
